gonna up and move?


01:02:59.442 --> 01:03:02.002
Like-- my daughter's
almost grown.


01:03:02.044 --> 01:03:04.239
Like, it's gone.
lt's gone.


01:03:08.885 --> 01:03:10.716
l just feel like
l'm running out of time.


01:03:10.753 --> 01:03:13.153
l feel like she's about
to leave me, you know.


01:03:13.189 --> 01:03:16.681
And l'm here now, you know,
and l wanna be there.


01:03:19.495 --> 01:03:22.487
Like l said, this is just one
of them days, you know?


01:03:36.746 --> 01:03:38.270
Okay, so this
promoter named MJ-2


01:03:38.314 --> 01:03:40.214
