Definitely can't be gay.


01:04:02.271 --> 01:04:04.034
So, what's up?
You gonna introduce me or what?


01:04:04.073 --> 01:04:05.472
You gonna hook me up?


01:04:10.613 --> 01:04:12.171
l can't believe you get
this much ass.


01:04:14.483 --> 01:04:16.474
