and ask your wife


01:06:24.580 --> 01:06:26.013
what she think about your
little two-timing ways.


01:06:26.048 --> 01:06:28.539
Bitch, don't you ever try
to threaten me or my family.


01:06:28.584 --> 01:06:30.279
l will have your ass killed.


01:06:30.319 --> 01:06:32.787
Go ahead! Please!


01:06:32.822 --> 01:06:34.722
l got the virus.


01:06:34.757 --> 01:06:37.851
l'm already dead,
motherfucker! What?


01:06:37.893 --> 01:06:40.020
And let me tell you something:
l don't give a fuck


01:06:40.062 --> 01:06:42.860
