when we were using.


01:08:20.763 --> 01:08:22.731
But you saying l could be
a bitch sometimes?


01:08:22.765 --> 01:08:24.164
Yeah.


01:08:25.301 --> 01:08:26.962
Well, damn, you could've
hesitated or something.


01:08:27.002 --> 01:08:30.301
l guess l could have,
but what's true is true.


01:08:31.407 --> 01:08:32.874
You being honest
or you being funny?


01:08:32.908 --> 01:08:35.342
Both.


01:08:50.526 --> 01:08:52.687
l love you,
but sometimes...


01:08:52.728 --> 01:08:54.320
