01:09:32.835 --> 01:09:34.860
Hardly.


01:09:34.904 --> 01:09:36.633
l've been all over.


01:09:39.508 --> 01:09:41.703
l said some wild shit
tonight about dying.


01:09:41.744 --> 01:09:43.609
